g = RAM 0x602BE878 (the unused row-1 slot of the value-list table, .data initial 0): set to 1 in createTimeLapseMovie after an accepted request (0x7ECDA56C -> T3 0x7ECB0E80), cleared in receiveEndCreateMovie / receiveErrorCreateMovie (0x7ECDA1B2 -> 0x7ECB0E98, 0x7ECDA1D5 -> 0x7ECB0EB0), tested in receiveEndMediaMountForEndWait (0x7ECDA2A7 -> T6 0x7ECB0EC8: when set, the end check 0x7ECDA7D1 is skipped), as the E-PL6 does with 0x602B4B20. NOT BUILT, NOT CAMERA-TESTED. Restore = the previous build (seven-films-6) or stock v1.6.",
